This project is developed from the AV1 Bitstream & Decoding Process Specification
(Alliance for Open Media). Verification uses dav1d (VideoLAN, BSD-2-Clause) and
libaom (Alliance for Open Media, BSD-2-Clause with the AOM patent license) as
reference decoders; they are fetched by bootstrap.sh and are not part of this
repository except for the trace hooks applied by tools/dav1d_trace_patch.py.
